### 1. Criar usuário de teste
POST http://localhost:3000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rafael@email.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "nome": "Rafael",
  "username": "Rafael"
}

###

### 2. Fazer login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rafael@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

###

### 3. Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:3000/categorias
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjIsImVtYWlsIjoiYnJicmlsbEBlbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTI3ODQ2MzEsImV4cCI6MTc5Mjg3MTAzMX0.LNlgIf44Z-mwoiLNLfp90fuSaCCCz-pMp889C7YBM0I

{
  "nome": "Produtos de Limpeza"
}

###

